OL,3,GNEWSACanal to temporarily reopen as
OL,4,Awater levels rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of a canal in Leicestershire
OL,7,Fis set to reopen temporarily next week
OL,8,Fafter an improvement in water levels.
OL,10,FFoxton Locks initially introduced
OL,11,Frestricted hours on 13 July due to low
OL,12,Fwater levels before fully closing to
OL,13,Fboat navigation on 1 September.
OL,15,FThe Canal and River Trust said the
OL,16,Fsite, near Market Harborough, would be
OL,17,Fopen to boats from 22 to 24 October,
OL,18,Fbetween 10:00 and 15:00 BST each day.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
