OL,3,GNEWSACanal to temporarily reopen as
OL,4,Awater levels rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said the reopening would help
OL,7,Ftransfer water northwards to support
OL,8,Fwater levels further along the canal,
OL,9,Fincluding an environmentally sensitive
OL,10,Fsite of special scientific interest
OL,11,Fsection where water levels remained
OL,12,F"under pressure".
